{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51840","headline":"望樊川 · 澹交","name":"望樊川","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万树叶初红，人家树色中。\n疎钟摇雨足，积水浸云容。\n雪碛回寒雁，村灯促夜舂。\n旧山归未得，生计欲何从？\n（《古今图书集成·职方典》五二○《西安府部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"澹交","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51840.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51840","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}